{"seq":3,"slug":"epr-fee-reconciliation-audit","title":"EPR 费用核算、对账与审计应对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-epr-registration/epr-fee-reconciliation-audit","wordCount":3032,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"epr-费用核算-对账与审计应对\">EPR 费用核算、对账与审计应对</h1><p>一份德国包装系统参与（Systembeteiligung）合同签下之后，跨境卖家真正按月面对的是一张账单：<strong>费用 = 申报量 × 材料费率</strong>。这个式子里，申报量由你自己的台账决定（见同章 <a href=\"packaging-data-collection-declaration\">包装用量数据采集、归类与申报测算</a>），而费率由系统运营商（Systembetreiber，即 PRO）每年公布的价目表决定。两件事都不归你完全掌控，但<strong>两者都会因为一次对账失败而回溯重算</strong>——多缴是沉没成本，少缴则在运营商控制报告（control report）与 LUCID 申报比对时变成低报（under-participation）认定。本文把&quot;费率怎么来—钱怎么算—三方数字怎么闭合—审计来了拿什么应对&quot;这条<strong>资金与证据链</strong>拆开，因为它是 EPR 义务中唯一直接兑换成现金流的一环。义务角色切分见 <a href=\"../packaging-regulation-framework/obligation-role-responsibility-matrix\">义务主体、角色与责任矩阵</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-费率-计费科目与三方对账\">核心概念：费率、计费科目与三方对账</h2><p>EPR 费用管理有三个必须同时成立的事实：<strong>费率由运营商定价而非国家统一定价</strong>、<strong>账面费用由若干异质科目叠加而非单一回收单价</strong>、<strong>计费依据必须由三方独立记录交叉闭合</strong>。任何一环只做一半，都会转化为回溯重算的现金流风险。</p>\n<h3 id=\"费率不是法定单价-而是运营商年度价目表\">费率不是法定单价，而是运营商年度价目表</h3><p>一个常见误解是&quot;回收费用是国家定的&quot;。实际上在德国，<strong>费用水平由市场协商</strong>：生产者与系统运营商签订系统参与合同，费率写在运营商当年公布的价目表（Preisliste / Leistungsverzeichnis）里，按<strong>材料类别</strong>分档、以<strong>每吨</strong>计价（来源：ZSVR, System participation / FAQ &quot;Costs&quot;）。ZSVR 只做登记（LUCID）与市场份额核算，不设定价格。同一批包装换个运营商，报价可能差出两位数百分比——<strong>&quot;货比三家&quot;是合法的成本优化，而非合规风险</strong>。</p>\n<p>费率档差的核心逻辑是<strong>回收成本与可回收性</strong>。塑料通常远贵于纸与玻璃，因为其分选、清洗、再生链条成本高、终端市场价值低；铝、铁质金属因有稳定再生市场而居中。量级示意（非具体报价）如下表，实际数字以签约运营商当年价目表为准：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>材料类别</th>\n<th>相对费率量级</th>\n<th>成本驱动因素</th>\n<th>生态调节方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>玻璃</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>收集与熔融成本稳定，闭环成熟</td>\n<td>常无奖惩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纸/纸板/卡纸</td>\n<td>低—中</td>\n<td>纤维回收成熟，受纸价波动</td>\n<td>常无奖惩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铁质金属</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>磁选容易，再生市场稳定</td>\n<td>常无奖惩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铝</td>\n<td>中—高</td>\n<td>价值高但分选要求高</td>\n<td>有时给再生含量奖励</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饮料纸盒</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>复合材质，需专门打浆分离</td>\n<td>常按复合处理收附加费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>塑料</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>分选清洗成本高、再生料需求不稳</td>\n<td>强生态调节（奖惩幅度大）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>费用总额服从一个求和式。设目标国投放市场中材料 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 的申报量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（吨），该材料所属档位费率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（欧元/吨），则年度基础回收费用为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>m</mi></munder><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\text{base}} = \\sum_{m} V_m \\cdot r_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若某材料适用生态调节系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（奖励 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>、惩罚 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），则实际费用为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>m</mi></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = \\sum_m V_m \\cdot r_m \\cdot \\alpha_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不是自由裁量，而是由合同条款预设的可回收性判据触发</strong>——这正是 PPWR（(EU) 2025/40）把&quot;费用生态调节&quot;（eco-modulation）写入生产者责任章节的原因：设计端每减一克难回收材料，费率端就被乘上一个更小的系数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二-账单里不只有-回收费-三类科目要分开记账\">二、账单里不只有&quot;回收费&quot;：三类科目要分开记账</h2><p>把 EPR 成本只按回收单价估算，是预算失误的高频来源。实际年度支出至少由三个科目构成，性质完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>科目</th>\n<th>计费基础</th>\n<th>是否随用量线性变动</th>\n<th>常见误区</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>系统参与费（回收费）</td>\n<td>申报吨数 × 材料费率</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>只算这个科目，低估总额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态调节奖惩</td>\n<td>基础费 × 调节系数偏离</td>\n<td>是（受设计影响）</td>\n<td>未在设计阶段估算，临报才发现惩罚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行政与审计成本</td>\n<td>固定或按次</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>忽略完整性声明审计费、授权代表费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>行政与审计成本</strong>在超过审计门槛后会突然跳升。德国<strong>完整性声明（Vollständigkeitserklärung）</strong> 的触发门槛是上一年度达到或超过任一阈值：玻璃 80 吨、纸/纸板/卡纸 50 吨、轻质包装合计 30 吨（涵盖铁质金属、铝、塑料、饮料纸盒及其他复合材料）。一旦触发，就必须委托在 LUCID 注册的专家、审计师、税务顾问或宣誓会计师出具审计确认，审计须在指定审计方<strong>之前</strong>已存在合同关系，且生产者声明与审计确认都需用<strong>合格电子签名</strong>签署（来源：ZSVR, Declaration of completeness）。审计费是按次计的固定支出，与吨数无关，但<strong>未预留它会直接吃掉一批小批量高单价商品的利润</strong>。</p>\n<p>法国的对应科目同构：生产者向生态组织（如 CITEO）缴纳&quot;生态贡献&quot;（contribution），其<strong>费率表（barème）同样按材料分档并叠加生态调节奖惩</strong>，对可回收性差、含干扰物质或未达再生含量目标的包装施加惩罚系数（来源：CITEO, barème / éco-modulation）。跨境卖家在法国还须先持有 ADEME 通过 SYDEREP 平台发放的 UIN，才能进入生态组织的申报通道（登记流程见同章 <a href=\"epr-registration-identifier-lifecycle\">EPR 注册与包装登记号生命周期管理</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三-对账-三方数字必须闭合-缺口就是低报证据\">三、对账：三方数字必须闭合，缺口就是低报证据</h2><p>对账（reconciliation）的目标只有一个：让<strong>三个独立记录的数字完全相等</strong>。任何两方相等而第三方偏离，都会在监管侧留下可追溯的差异痕迹。三方是：<strong>你的内部台账</strong>（SKU × 材料 × 单位重量 × 投放件数的明细表）、<strong>运营商的合同数字</strong>（写进合同、用于计费的申报量）、<strong>LUCID 的申报数字</strong>（你在官方登记平台录入的同一批数据）。</p>\n<p>闭合机制不靠信任，而靠<strong>运营商的控制报告</strong>：运营商必须向 ZSVR 提交控制报告，ZSVR 将其与生产者的 LUCID 申报逐条比对，并据此计算各运营商的市场份额（来源：ZSVR, Data reporting）。因此&quot;只报运营商、不报 LUCID&quot;或&quot;两份数字不一致&quot;都不是隐蔽的操作，而是会被系统自动标出的差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[内部台账&lt;br/&gt;SKU x 材料 x 重量 x 件数] --&gt; D[三方逐项比对]&#10;    B[运营商合同量&lt;br/&gt;计费依据] --&gt; D&#10;    C[LUCID 申报量&lt;br/&gt;官方登记] --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; E{三者是否完全一致?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[费用结算确认&lt;br/&gt;归档为审计证据]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[定位差异类型]&#10;    G --&gt; H[复合包装未拆层&lt;br/&gt;或件数口径错误]&#10;    G --&gt; I[材料标签错配&lt;br/&gt;或修正时序颠倒]&#10;    H --&gt; J[先通知运营商&lt;br/&gt;确认后报 LUCID]&#10;    I --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n    A[内部台账&lt;br/&gt;SKU x 材料 x 重量 x 件数] --&gt; D[三方逐项比对]\n    B[运营商合同量&lt;br/&gt;计费依据] --&gt; D\n    C[LUCID 申报量&lt;br/&gt;官方登记] --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; E{三者是否完全一致?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[费用结算确认&lt;br/&gt;归档为审计证据]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[定位差异类型]\n    G --&gt; H[复合包装未拆层&lt;br/&gt;或件数口径错误]\n    G --&gt; I[材料标签错配&lt;br/&gt;或修正时序颠倒]\n    H --&gt; J[先通知运营商&lt;br/&gt;确认后报 LUCID]\n    I --&gt; J\n    J --&gt; D</pre><p><strong>修正的时序不可颠倒</strong>：生产者必须先向系统运营商通报调整后的用量，待运营商确认后，再把确认的数字报送 LUCID；先改 LUCID 再通知运营商是一种会被控制报告暴露的顺序错误（来源：ZSVR, Data reporting）。年内调整按&quot;年内用量报告&quot;提交，年度结束后的调整按&quot;年终用量报告&quot;提交。</p>\n<p>对账缺口几乎总落在四类可预测来源上，做成固定的月度检查项即可把低报风险压到最低：<strong>拆层缺失</strong>（饮料纸盒整件按&quot;纸&quot;申报、铝与塑料消失，须按质量占比重算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、<strong>件数口径</strong>（用订单件数代替投放件数，须以实际进入目标国市场的件数为准）、<strong>材料错配</strong>（生物基塑料按&quot;纸&quot;归类，须按材料属性而非外观归类）、<strong>时序颠倒</strong>（先改 LUCID 后通知运营商，须恢复&quot;先运营商、后 LUCID&quot;顺序）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四-审计应对-证据包在申报前就应备好\">四、审计应对：证据包在申报前就应备好</h2><p>EPR 审计分两类，应对方式不同，但<strong>共用同一套证据</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>第一类：完整性声明审计。</strong> 触发门槛如上，法定截止日为<strong>次年 5 月 15 日且不可延期</strong>，由三部分组成：LUCID 生成的&quot;生产者声明&quot;、审计师的审计确认、审计师的审计报告（来源：ZSVR, Declaration of completeness）。审计师按抽样验证&quot;申报量是否真实反映投放市场量&quot;，因此台账必须<strong>可追溯到单据</strong>：每一吨申报量都能沿&quot;数量汇总 → SKU 明细 → 采购/生产记录 → 投放凭证&quot;反向走到源单据。仅有一张汇总表而无明细支撑，抽样阶段就会被判证据不足。</p>\n<p><strong>第二类：市场监管与运营商核查。</strong> 市场监督机构可在任意时点要求出示投放量与登记凭证；运营商在日常对账中也可能发起用量核查。这类核查不看你的事后报告，而看<strong>当时的原始记录</strong>——证据必须在申报时点同步归档，事后补做台账不可接受。</p>\n<p>一份可直接应对两类审计的<strong>证据包</strong>应包含：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证据项</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>审计中的用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>包装 BOM</td>\n<td>每 SKU 每层材料、单位重量、采集方法</td>\n<td>证明 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{i,m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 口径一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>称重记录</td>\n<td>精度到 0.1 g 的实测原始数据</td>\n<td>支撑完整性声明基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投放量台账</td>\n<td>按期间归集的件数与千克数</td>\n<td>证明 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 真实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三方对账表</td>\n<td>台账 / 合同量 / LUCID 逐项对照</td>\n<td>证明三个数字闭合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修正留痕</td>\n<td>每次调整的通知时间与运营商确认</td>\n<td>证明时序合规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>登记与授权文件</td>\n<td>LUCID 号、UIN、授权代表协议</td>\n<td>证明主体适格</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"五-罚款-追溯与-2026-换轨下的预算处理\">五、罚款、追溯与 2026 换轨下的预算处理</h2><p>低报的后果不是&quot;补缴差价&quot;这么简单。差异一旦被控制报告或审计标出，会触发<strong>回溯重算</strong>：按差异量补缴费用、可能加收滞纳与罚金，并在极端情形下影响登记状态。德国《包装法》体系下，未登记/未参与系统/未申报的违规可被处以罚款，并可能伴随<strong>销售禁令</strong>（distribution ban）——对跨境卖家而言，这个后果比罚款更致命，因为它直接切断平台销售权限。&quot;为了省回收费而低报&quot;因此是一笔期望值为负的交易。</p>\n<p>在 2026 年换轨背景下，预算模型需要额外留出缓冲。<strong>2026 年 8 月 12 日</strong>起，欧盟 PPWR（(EU) 2025/40）正式适用，同日德国《包装法实施法》（VerpackDG）取代原《包装法》，两者同时生效（来源：ZSVR, &quot;What changed on 12 August 2026&quot;；欧盟委员会包装与包装废弃物专题页）。对费用核算有三处直接影响：生态调节成为强制项（设计参数进入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，预算须按情景分档）；审计格式切换（自 2026 参考年度起审计师提交遵循 VerpackDG 的统一格式声明，通常申报日为 2027 年 5 月 15 日）；非系统参与包装自 <strong>2027 年底</strong>起需 ZSVR 授权并缴费，该成本应单列。</p>\n<p><strong>预算与对账节奏</strong>可固化为：年初按去年费率与预测用量滚动预测费用，季度按价目表更新费率，月度做三方对账，次年 5 月 15 日前完成（如触发的）完整性声明审计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>费率由<strong>运营商年度价目表</strong>决定，不是法定单价；按材料分档，塑料显著高于纸与玻璃，生态调节系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 让设计端与费用端联动。</li>\n<li>年度支出 = 系统参与费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 生态调节奖惩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 行政与审计成本；触发完整性声明门槛后审计费为固定跳升。</li>\n<li>对账要求<strong>内部台账、运营商合同量、LUCID 申报量三方完全闭合</strong>，缺口即低报证据；修正顺序恒为&quot;<strong>先通知运营商，后报 LUCID</strong>&quot;。</li>\n<li>审计应对靠<strong>申报前就备好的可追溯证据包</strong>，而非事后补账；完整性声明截止 5 月 15 日不可延期。</li>\n<li>2026 年 8 月 12 日 PPWR 与 VerpackDG 同步换轨，生态调节转为强制、审计格式切换、非系统参与包装增授权成本。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"EPR 费用核算、对账与审计应对","id":"epr-费用核算-对账与审计应对"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：费率、计费科目与三方对账","id":"核心概念-费率-计费科目与三方对账"},{"level":3,"text":"费率不是法定单价，而是运营商年度价目表","id":"费率不是法定单价-而是运营商年度价目表"},{"level":2,"text":"二、账单里不只有\"回收费\"：三类科目要分开记账","id":"二-账单里不只有-回收费-三类科目要分开记账"},{"level":2,"text":"三、对账：三方数字必须闭合，缺口就是低报证据","id":"三-对账-三方数字必须闭合-缺口就是低报证据"},{"level":2,"text":"四、审计应对：证据包在申报前就应备好","id":"四-审计应对-证据包在申报前就应备好"},{"level":2,"text":"五、罚款、追溯与 2026 换轨下的预算处理","id":"五-罚款-追溯与-2026-换轨下的预算处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"包装用量数据采集、归类与申报测算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-epr-registration/packaging-data-collection-declaration"},"next":{"title":"包装标识、分类回收标志与材质标注规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-regulation-ppwr-sustainability/packaging-mark-compliance/labeling-sorting-mark-spec"}}